#ASSERT `Under Article 3(14a), as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, am I a micro, small or medium-sized enterprise` (Date 26 7 2026) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- 27 July 2026 (text as amended), an SME: JUST TRUE ('micro, small and medium-sized enterprise' or 'SME' means a micro, small or medium-sized enterprise as defined in Article 2 of the Annex to Recommendation 2003/361/EC)
-- MIRROR Art 3(14a): the same enterprise asked from the provider, deployer and model provider seats
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(14a), as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, am I a micro, small or medium-sized enterprise` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
