§ `The role and the applicability of the provisions`

-- develops and places on the market under its own name a model that displays significant generality, is capable of a wide range of tasks and can be integrated downstream
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a, as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, am I a provider of a general-purpose AI model within the meaning of Article 3(3) and (63)` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the model does not display significant generality
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a, as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, am I a provider of a general-purpose AI model within the meaning of Article 3(3) and (63)` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not under its own name or trademark: not a provider
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a, as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, am I a provider of a general-purpose AI model within the meaning of Article 3(3) and (63)` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- the day before Chapter I applies (Art 113(a): 2 February 2025)
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a, as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, does Chapter I apply on the date asked` (Date 1 2 2025) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the day Chapter I begins to apply
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a, as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, does Chapter I apply on the date asked` (Date 2 2 2025) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the first day of the text as amended
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a, as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, does Chapter I apply on the date asked` (Date 27 7 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE


§ `Under Article 4a: processing special categories of personal data for bias detection and correction`

-- special categories, every element met, by a party the paragraph names
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a(2), as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, may I exceptionally process special categories of personal data to ensure bias detection and correction` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not special categories of personal data
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a(2), as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, may I exceptionally process special categories of personal data to ensure bias detection and correction` (Date 27 7 2026) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- not met: appropriate safeguards for the fundamental rights and freedoms of natural persons are in place
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a(2), as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, may I exceptionally process special categories of personal data to ensure bias detection and correction` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the provisions set out in Regulations (EU) 2016/679 and (EU) 2018/1725 and Directive (EU) 2016/680, as applicable, are also complied with
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a(2), as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, may I exceptionally process special categories of personal data to ensure bias detection and correction` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the bias detection and correction cannot be effectively fulfilled by processing other data, including synthetic or anonymised data
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a(2), as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, may I exceptionally process special categories of personal data to ensure bias detection and correction` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the special categories of personal data are subject to technical limitations on the re-use of personal data, and state-of-the-art security and privacy-preserving measures, including pseudonymisation
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a(2), as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, may I exceptionally process special categories of personal data to ensure bias detection and correction` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the special categories of personal data are subject to measures to ensure that the personal data processed are secured and protected, subject to suitable safeguards, including strict controls and documentation of the access, to avoid misuse and to ensure that only authorised persons have access to those personal data with appropriate confidentiality obligations
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a(2), as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, may I exceptionally process special categories of personal data to ensure bias detection and correction` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the special categories of personal data are not transmitted, transferred or otherwise accessed by other parties
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a(2), as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, may I exceptionally process special categories of personal data to ensure bias detection and correction` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the special categories of personal data are deleted once the bias has been corrected or the personal data has reached the end of its retention period, whichever comes first
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a(2), as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, may I exceptionally process special categories of personal data to ensure bias detection and correction` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the records of processing activities pursuant to Regulations (EU) 2016/679 and (EU) 2018/1725 and Directive (EU) 2016/680 include the reasons why the processing of special categories of personal data was strictly necessary to detect and correct biases, and why that objective could not be achieved by processing other data
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a(2), as a provider of a general-purpose AI model, may I exceptionally process special categories of personal data to ensure bias detection and correction` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
